---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Topics
seoTitle: "F1 topic hubs · Grid and Pit"
summary: Browse Grid and Pit by desk and by the American races. Each hub lists sourced Formula 1 stories, with session times in ET, CT, MT and PT.
updatedAt: 2026-11-12
permalink: /topics/
---
<p>These pages group our Formula 1 reporting by desk, and by the three American grands prix plus Cadillac. Every story links the public source for each fact.</p>
<h2>Desks</h2>
<ul class="story-list">
{% for item in site.categories %}
  {% set stories = collections.posts | whereCategory(item.name) %}
  <li>
    <article class="story">
      <div class="story-copy">
        <p class="kicker">{{ stories.length }} {{ "story" if stories.length == 1 else "stories" }}</p>
        <h2 class="story-title"><a href="{{ ('/topics/' ~ item.slug ~ '/') | url }}">{{ item.name }}</a></h2>
        <p class="deck">{{ item.hubIntro }}</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
<h2>American race and team hubs</h2>
<ul class="story-list">
{% for hub in site.hubs %}
  <li>
    <article class="story">
      <div class="story-copy">
        <h2 class="story-title"><a href="{{ ('/hubs/' ~ hub.slug ~ '/') | url }}">{{ hub.title }}</a></h2>
        <p class="deck">{{ hub.intro }}</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
